dates go_time_function v1
description "A date with a time, and a date whose alias is the time's function with an underscore at its end. Go spells cutoff_at and cutoff_at_ alike, CutoffAt, so the Go code does not compile (W001). Every other target takes them as they are"
use calendar "../fixtures/calendars/weekends.cal"

inputs
  ordered : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31

date cutoff = ordered
  roll following
  at 17:00

date cutoff_at_ = ordered
  + 1 day
  roll following
